## TODO Difficulty Ratings

Every TODO item must include a difficulty tag:

| Tag | Meaning |
|-----|---------|
| `[D1]` | Trivial — config tweak, small copy change |
| `[D2]` | Easy — small new component or simple API change |
| `[D3]` | Medium — new feature with DB + API + UI |
| `[D4]` | Hard — multi-system change, complex workflow |
| `[D5]` | Very Hard — architectural change or major integration |

Work lowest difficulty first within each priority section unless the PM specifies otherwise.

