## Ticket System (Mission Control)

**OpenClaw Mission Control has a built-in ticket tracker.** Every project has a `tickets/` directory. Always use this system — do not invent your own TODO list for bugs and features.

Ticket location:
```
[project-path]/tickets/open/     ← active tickets
[project-path]/tickets/closed/   ← resolved tickets
```

Ticket types: `BUG-NNN`, `FEAT-NNN`, `TASK-NNN`, `QUESTION-NNN`, `EPIC-NNN`

Workflow: create ticket → do work → move file to `closed/` + set `Status: done`.

